{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16163","headline":"送裴相公上太原 · 王建","name":"送裴相公上太原","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"还携堂印向幷州，将相兼权是武侯。\n时难独当天下事，功成却进手中筹。\n再三陈乞罏烟里，前後封章玉案头。\n朱架早朝立劒戟，绿槐残雨看张油。\n遥知塞雁从今好，直得渔阳已北愁。\n边铺警巡旗尽换，山城候馆壁重修。\n千羣白刃兵迎节，十对红妆妓打球。\n圣主分明交暂去，不须高起见京楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}